{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00733",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 3.67,
      "end_seconds": 15.56,
      "duration_seconds": 11.89,
      "text": "Hello, Mr Stone, I'm Kate, the nurse. The doctor asked me to do your psoriasis review with her. How are your skin and joints?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.26,
      "end_seconds": 29.36,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "Um, hi. I'm not sure there's much to say. It's a bit better. Sorry, I get nervous. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 33.3,
      "end_seconds": 39.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "No need to be. Where is it at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.84,
      "end_seconds": 51.49,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "Elbows mainly, and a bit on the scalp. Scaly patches. They've shrunk since the summer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 54.95,
      "end_seconds": 61.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "That's good. Are you getting any joint pain or stiffness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.45,
      "end_seconds": 68.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "No. No, my joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.6,
      "end_seconds": 81.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.02,
      "text": "Hello, Mr Stone. Kate's updated me. Can I just look at the elbows? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.09,
      "end_seconds": 99.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.03,
      "end_seconds": 110.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "They've improved a lot since I last saw them, and I'm pleased. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.66,
      "end_seconds": 117.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "That's good, isn't it? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.63,
      "end_seconds": 126.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Yes, very. What are you doing for them these days? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.05,
      "end_seconds": 133.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Nothing, really. Just moisturising. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.38,
      "end_seconds": 146.15,
      "duration_seconds": 8.77,
      "text": "That's fine, that's what I'd hoped you'd manage. The sunshine over the summer probably helped. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.0,
      "end_seconds": 153.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "We went to Spain. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.93,
      "end_seconds": 167.22,
      "duration_seconds": 10.29,
      "text": "There you are. And how is your mood, are you coping all right? Psoriasis can get you down. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.69,
      "end_seconds": 174.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "A bit nervous, but fine. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 178.33,
      "end_seconds": 186.6,
      "duration_seconds": 8.27,
      "text": "It's very common to feel self-conscious. Do you want some information on a support group? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.92,
      "end_seconds": 194.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Maybe. Yes, please. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 198.6,
      "end_seconds": 202.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "I'll print it for you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.29,
      "end_seconds": 214.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "text": "Mr Stone, the key thing is to keep moisturising every day, especially after a bath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.52,
      "end_seconds": 222.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Right. I do it every night. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.4,
      "end_seconds": 234.85,
      "duration_seconds": 8.45,
      "text": "Good. Avoid scratching, and keep your nails short. Try not to pick at the scalp."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.33,
      "end_seconds": 240.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 244.49,
      "end_seconds": 250.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "And remember sunscreen, on the bits that aren't affected. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.44,
      "end_seconds": 256.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "I'll remember. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.32,
      "end_seconds": 279.49,
      "duration_seconds": 18.17,
      "text": "Right, I'm happy with you today. If it flares up again, or you get any joint pain or swelling, or your nails start changing, come back and we'll treat it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.62,
      "end_seconds": 286.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "I will. Thank you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 290.24,
      "end_seconds": 293.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Here's the leaflet, Mr Stone. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.9,
      "end_seconds": 300.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Thanks, Kate. Bye, doctor. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.73,
      "end_seconds": 306.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Take care. ~"
    }
  ]
}
